EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, COSTS OFF, TIMING OFF, SUMMARY OFF, BUFFERS OFF)
  SELECT a FROM cs WHERE a IN (5, 50000, 99999);
                      QUERY PLAN                       
-------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (ChScan) on cs (actual rows=3.00 loops=1)
   Filter: (a = ANY ('{5,50000,99999}'::integer[]))
   Rows Removed by Filter: 2589
   Columns: a
   Pruning: (a = ANY ('{5,50000,99999}'::integer[]))
   Granules: 3 read of 100, parts pruned: 2
(6 rows)

