(1 row)

EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, COSTS OFF, TIMING OFF, SUMMARY OFF, BUFFERS OFF)
  SELECT a FROM cs WHERE a < 100 OR a > 99900;
                       QUERY PLAN                        
---------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (ChScan) on cs (actual rows=199.00 loops=1)
   Filter: ((a < 100) OR (a > 99900))
   Rows Removed by Filter: 1369
   Columns: a
   Pruning: ((a < 100) OR (a > 99900))
